#: abf4f502734d42a6a748ecaa1467c3fb fbfee17d7f8042a2907a7177baee2ec4
msgid ""
"Pixhawk 5X® is the latest update to the successful family of Pixhawk® "
"autopilots made by Holybro, featuring vibration isolation of IMUs, triple "
"redundant IMUs, double redundant barometers on separate buses, and IMU "
"heating."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 5X® 是 Holybro 生产的 Pixhawk® 飞控系列的最新版本，具备 IMU 隔振、三重冗余 "
"IMU、分布在独立总线上的双冗余气压计以及 IMU 加热功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:16
