msgid ""
"This board also includes integrated Ethernet but ArduPilot's networking "
"support is not enabled on F7 boards (`see issue here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/26397>`__)"
msgstr ""
"该板还集成了以太网，但 ArduPilot 的网络支持在 F7 板上未启用（`详见此问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/26397>`__）"

